nd parts, and the checkout section (address/delivery/place order) is hidden\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"I-4\",\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Checkout fields (address, delivery option) are required inputs gating the 'Place order' button; totals shown live\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     \"0: Delivery address text field accepts 5-200 characters; values outside this range are rejected/flagged as invalid\",\n     \"1: Delivery option selector offers Standard (£0) and Next day (£9.99) as mutually exclusive choices\",\n     \"2: Checkout displays subtotal, delivery charge, and total where total = subtotal + delivery charge, updating live as cart/delivery option changes\",\n     \"3: 'Place order' button remains disabled until a valid address (5-200 chars) and a delivery option are both selected\",\n     \"4: Attempting to submit with missing/invalid address or no delivery option does not place the order and keeps button disabled (no partial submission)\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"I-5\",\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Order placement creates an order record with generated order number and Placed status; order history lists all of buyer's past orders newest first\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     \"0: Pressing 'Place order' (when enabled) creates an order with a unique order number formatted 'ORD-' plus 6 digits, status set to Placed, current date recorded\",\n     \"1: Order is saved with its lines (part, quantity, unit price), delivery address, delivery option, and total\",\n     \"2: Placing the order empties the cart (all lines removed) and the header cart count resets\",\n     \"3: After placing an order, the new order number is displayed to the buyer as confirmation\",\n     \"4: My orders screen lists the buyer's orders newest first, each row showing order number, date, number of items, total and status\",\n     \"5: When the buyer has placed no orders, My orders shows 'No orders yet' with a link to Find parts\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"I-6\",\n    \