ge load target applies to the Find parts listing page under a 5,000-part catalogue, using pagination (20 per page) rather than loading all parts at once\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     \"0: With 5,000 parts in the database, loading /parts (and /cart, /orders) completes in under 2 seconds\",\n     \"1: Search, filter and pagination requests against the 5,000-part catalogue return results within the 2-second budget\",\n     \"2: Performance target is measured/validated against a seeded dataset of 5,000 parts prior to release\"\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n },\n {\n  \"sketch\": 3,\n  \"spans\": [\n   {\n    \"id\": \"I-1\",\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Exactly three screens: Find parts (/parts), Cart and checkout (/cart), My orders (/orders with order detail panel on same page); no other screens built in this release; sign-in/accounts out of scope and assumed already handled.\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     \"0: Navigating to /parts shows the Find parts screen\",\n     \"1: Navigating to /cart shows the Cart and checkout screen\",\n     \"2: Navigating to /orders shows My orders list with an order detail panel on the same page (not a separate route)\",\n     \"3: No sign-in/login screen, admin screen, or any screen beyond these three is implemented\",\n     \"4: A buyer only ever sees their own data; the system relies on existing company login for identity rather than implementing its own\",\n     \"5: Header shows a running cart item count visible across the three screens\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"I-2\",\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Search is substring match on name or part number (case-insensitive, min 2 chars); category and brand filters combine with search via AND logic.\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     \"0: Parts list shows 20 parts per page with image, name, part number, brand, price, and stock state\",\n     \"1: Stock state displayed as 'In stock' (>=5), 'Low stock (n left)' (1-4), 'Out of stock' (0), using text not colour alone\",\n     \"2: Typing fewer than 2 characters in search does not filter the list\",\n     \"3: Typing 2+ characters filters to parts whose name or part number contains the text, case-insensitive\",\n     \"4: Selecting a category filter shows only parts in that category\",\n     \"5: Selecting a brand filter shows only parts of that brand\",\n     \"6: Combining search text with category/brand filters narrows results by all active criteria simultaneously\",\n     \"7: When no part matches current search/filters, show 'No parts match' message with a button to clear search and filters, which restores the full unfiltered list\",\n     \"8: 'Add to cart' button is disabled (and not clickable) for out-of-stock parts\",\n     \"9: Pressing 'Add to cart' on an in-stock part adds one unit to the cart, incrementing quantity if already present, and updates the header cart count immediately\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"I-3\",\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Quantity field allows direct edits between 1-99 but is clamped to available stock; 'Remove' deletes the whole line, not decrement to zero.\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     \"0: Cart shows each line with name, part number, unit price, editable quantity field, and line total\",\n     \"1: Changing a quantity recalculates the line total and overall order total immediately without page reload\",\n     \"2: Entering a quantity above available stock resets the field to the stock quantity and shows 'Only n available' message\",\n     \"3: Quantity values are constrained to the 1-99 range\",\n     \"4: Pressing 'Remove' on a line deletes that line entirely from the cart\",\n     \"5: When all lines are removed, cart becomes empty and shows the empty-cart state (see I-4 empty cart behaviour)\",\n     \"6: Cart count in header reflects additions, quantity changes, and removals in real time\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"I-4\",\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Checkout fields (address textbox, delivery option radio/select) are on the same /cart page; 'Place order' button 