ail panel with lines, delivery address, delivery option, total, and status timeline\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"I-6\",\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Cancellation is only possible while status is exactly 'Placed'; timeline shows four forward stages (Placed, Packed, Dispatched, Delivered) with Cancelled as a terminal state shown separately rather than on that linear path.\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     \"0: Status timeline visually represents the sequence Placed → Packed → Dispatched → Delivered, indicating the order's current stage\",\n     \"1: 'Cancel order' button appears only when order status is Placed\",\n     \"2: 'Cancel order' button does not appear for orders in Packed, Dispatched, Delivered, or already Cancelled status\",\n     \"3: Pressing 'Cancel order' prompts a confirmation step before cancelling\",\n     \"4: Confirming cancellation sets the order status to Cancelled and updates the orders list and detail panel accordingly\",\n     \"5: Declining/dismissing the confirmation leaves the order status unchanged\",\n     \"6: Stage/status indicators do not rely on colour alone (e.g., icons or text labels accompany colour)\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"I-7\",\n    \"readingChosen\": \"AA compliance and responsiveness apply across all three screens; responsive down to 360px width is the minimum supported breakpoint.\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     \"0: All interactive elements (search, filters, quantity fields, buttons, links) are operable via keyboard alone\",\n     \"1: Every form field across all screens has a visible or programmatically associated label\",\n     \"2: Stock state and order status are never conveyed by colour alone; text or icon accompanies colour\",\n     \"3: Screens render usably at widths from 360px up to desktop sizes without horizontal scrolling or broken layout\",\n     \"4: Focus order and visible focus indicators are present for keyboard navigation\",\n     \"5: Failure to meet contrast, label, or keyboard requiremen